{
  "version": 1,
  "script_path": "System/System_FireworksEpilogue",
  "title": "后日谈",
  "locale": "zh-Hans",
  "source": "source-poster.png",
  "credits": [
    "Bilibili@简易长矛汉化组",
    "原文与完整参与制作署名保留于随附原图 source-poster.png。"
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_001",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "透过天台的护栏，一阵阵低沉的轰鸣传来，连夜色都在随之轻颤。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_002",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "须臾之间，墨色长空中倏然绽开一簇焰火。金芒四散纷飞，"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_003",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "宛若漫天星辰四散消融。赤似流火，银似落雪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_004",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": "reveal",
      "color": null,
      "text": "每每烟火腾空，那光亮便映出立在身侧的希罗的侧脸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_005",
      "speaker": "Hiro",
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "「艾玛，烟花已经开场了。专心看烟花。毕竟这是我们的约定啊。」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_006",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "希罗直直地看着烟花，那认真过头的模样让我不由得笑了出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_007",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "主动提出要履行约定的人，正是希罗。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_008",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "收到那条消息时，我在欣喜之余，心里也缠上了一缕怅然。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_009",
      "speaker": "Hiro",
      "cue": "quiet",
      "color": null,
      "text": "「虽然不是三个人一起看……」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_010",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "三个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_011",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "希罗的声音变得消沉，目光也随之低垂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_012",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "于我，于希罗而言，重返这一承载着独特意义的地点，\n我们二人心中，都纠缠着万缕心绪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_013",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "毕竟，这里承载了太多回忆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_014",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "我抬手，轻轻摩挲了一下揣在胸袋里的钢笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_015",
      "speaker": "Ema",
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "「——不过啊，希罗。」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_016",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "我点亮手机屏幕。备注着“牢房”的群组里，\n一条条“我到了哦”的消息接连跃入眼帘。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_017",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "下一轮焰火升空的同时，我轻声说道。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_018",
      "speaker": "Ema",
      "cue": "together",
      "color": null,
      "text": "「现在我们有十三个人一起看哦。」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_019",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "天台的安全铁门吱呀一声打开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_020",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "夜色中，一道清亮洪亮的嗓音传了过来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_021",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#F0D367",
      "text": "「来吧各位，就在前面，跟我来！」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_022",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#F1AD45",
      "text": "「第一次来的话就不要瞎指挥了好吗！呜哇，怎么烟花已经开始了啊，得拍给我推看看才行！」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_023",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "紧随其后，是几道略显慵懒消沉的声线。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_024",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#F47981",
      "text": "「你们可真有精神啊……明明有不少人家住得挺远的。」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_025",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#CF84EA",
      "text": "「总感觉好久没来学校了呢。不觉得还蛮怀念的吗？」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_026",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#C4A6E3",
      "text": "「不知道…吾辈…爬楼梯…好累…」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_027",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#83DBC3",
      "text": "「诺亚还没去过初中呢，等下可以去美术室看看吗？」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_028",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "随即，更多热闹的声音交叠在一起。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_029",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#8CDBA0",
      "text": "「在这么暗的地方看书，可是会把眼睛看坏的说！？」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_030",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#E3CB63",
      "text": "「呜呜，可是大叔我最近想努力学习嘛…实在是不舍得把书放下啦…」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_031",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#E3CB63",
      "text": "「啊，烟花我当然会好好看的！」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_032",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#9199F0",
      "text": "「大叔是在朝着律师努力对吧！好热血～！我的目标是当个侦探！请务必和我合作！\n现在立刻马上！」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_033",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": "#C9CBD0",
      "text": "「姐姐，身体还好吧？」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_034",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "「完全没事～！奈奈，快分给大家尝尝吧。你为了今天特意做的……奈奈手作马卡龙！」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_035",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "欢声笑语渐渐融入夜色。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_036",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "身旁传来希罗的一声轻笑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_037",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "这一次，照亮她侧颊的并非烟火，而是大家的欢声笑语。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_038",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "我把手举得高高的，朝她们挥了挥。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_039",
      "speaker": "Ema",
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "「大家～在这边哦！」"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_040",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "胸前口袋中的钢笔，也随着我的动作晃了一晃。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_041",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "整片夜空之中，又一轮光华盛放。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Epilogue_042",
      "speaker": null,
      "cue": null,
      "color": null,
      "text": "——属于我们的时光，还远没有结束。"
    }
  ]
}
